{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03967","headline":"奉和幸三会寺应制 · 刘宪","name":"奉和幸三会寺应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迢嶤仓史台，敞朗绀园开。\n戒旦壶人集，翻霜羽骑来。\n下辇登三袭，褰旒望九垓。\n林披舘陶牓，水浸昆明灰。\n网户飞花缀，幡竿度鸟回。\n豫游仙唱动，潇洒出尘埃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘宪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03967.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03967","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}